      "content": "The United States Patent and Trademark Office (USPTO) provides REST APIs for patent search, PTAB trial proceedings, trademark status lookup, and patent citation data. APIs are hosted at developer.uspto.gov and data.uspto.gov. An ODP API key is required for most endpoints.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: USPTO Open Data Portal",
